      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": false,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Cluster 20 was isolated and characterized crystallographically after combining equimolar amounts of La4(O)(acac)10 (1) and HBpin. No mass, volume, concentration, temperature, time, or yield is reported. 11B NMR of the isolated solid showed resonances at 21.53, 4.96, and 4.43 ppm, and a B–O linkage was observed. Stoichiometric reaction of isolated 20 with one equivalent of N,N-dimethylbenzamide (6a) did not form the hydroboration product, so 20 is described as an inactive or off-cycle species.",
